<head rendition="#c"><hi rendition="#aq">IMPRIMATUR</hi></head><lb/>
<p rendition="#c"><hi rendition="#aq">Friburgi Helvetiorum die 26 Decembris anno 1895.</hi></p>
<signed><hi rendition="#aq">J. V. Pellerin, Vic. Gen.</hi>
</signed>
